title: "Sampling Theory for Persistent Laplacian Spectra on Random Geometric Complexes"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jin
    given-names: Qi
year: 2026
license: MIT
keywords:
  - persistent Laplacian
  - random geometric complex
  - spectral statistics
  - conformal prediction
  - subsampling
abstract: >-
  Code and archived results for a statistical theory of persistent Laplacian spectra on random
  geometric complexes: fixed-scale concentration, window-matched convergence, an exact harmonic
  identity, and kernel-matched subsampling confidence intervals.
